# GitHub language

- **GitHub** (issues, PR titles/bodies, commit messages, code review comments): write in **English**.

# Shipping / issues / PRs

For creating issues, finish-job closeout, and Aico PR linking, follow the **`aico-ship`** skill (do not patch upstream `pr` / `linear` skills).

Short rules (details in `aico-ship`):

- “Create an issue” → GitHub issue (EN)
- **No duplicate search** — create from this Cursor session; reuse only an `#n` already in this chat
- PR that finishes the work → one `Fixes #n` line **per** GitHub issue it closes (multiple issues → multiple `Fixes #n` lines)
- Auto-run closeout when the user asks to ship/PR/workflow, or the change is a clear product fix/feature; otherwise suggest once
